{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9a9af118fb070b9ccfffe457dc9d7a315c1a9d15b5a9df721a9412ecc3cf6c4f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_b:2_4_023_03_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df0e784d6b3968f2b5682efc1b797eead4721b6760a56ac2d8b57ec5367a9c4b",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n这么晚打扰真抱歉，能稍微聊几句吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_b:2_4_023_03_09_b:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eac45b6855021e10962477f5af1f545f3e25f3d1397bf8a1a1c5c53306cfe0cc",
      "text": "没问题哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_b:2_4_023_03_09_b:cmd-000009:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:addf5e74eb35718d0e1128ba904babab99e574ac61f08944c8dd74ae243db707",
      "text": "我还醒着呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_b:2_4_023_03_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f7645381a9f033e6034458a98aecb067442e2f319a82463fca61ebbcea5a689",
      "text": "太好了！其实有件事想跟制作人说说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_b:2_4_023_03_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a78377226bdab4c46c0a006a9cfecf49982ec9cf82eb7c5c04c1b3f36ff2849",
      "text": "今天大家不是一起去挑泰迪熊了吗？\n在现场不太好大声说出来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_b:2_4_023_03_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9daec40cbba62cc0b9c7317b91a85f22a5551fc20a0abdfcc6cd224a95fc030",
      "text": "其实，客人里有个女孩子戴着High×Joker的周边哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_b:2_4_023_03_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f25b3cbf0f400d2628a41467938976e20489a5c421abf217d034bbb198bddaf5",
      "text": "看着她高高兴兴挑泰迪熊的样子，\n肯定也很喜欢那家店吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_b:2_4_023_03_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d0868e3cc518a0498490e9d7f68da3affa832fe50f95a46e7f3ae1f2af80111",
      "text": "看到那一幕，我就觉得一定要做出一张让大家满意的海报才行！一下子就干劲满满了～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_b:2_4_023_03_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb2a00b38c4b36d11cfbb7dba2bfc11af1ec5e8a2bdb42be8555718f8ceb682b",
      "text": "一开始是我……哎呀，照这势头\n怕不是要聊到天亮了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_b:2_4_023_03_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:563594dbd4e9587a0f870490d657e749ab1fb485591750955ec213310e2ddce4",
      "text": "下次见面的时候我再详细跟你说吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_b:2_4_023_03_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:552f43585fa775c54c8248b7084ed8520414b6f7da4386830d01f95995821432",
      "text": "那今天先挂了。谢谢你听我说话。\n晚安！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
